{
  "text": " Behind her, along the boards, Noah was still at the gate-mast with Polglace, in the last of the light, with the day's tape unrolled on his desk. A boy from the board's wire office was standing beside him with a fistful of yellow forms. Noah was reading them one after another, with his pencil not moving, and his narrow face had a look on it that she had not seen there before.",
